---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

const windowsDownloadUrl = 'https://github.com/JayKeenan/chauncy-web/releases/download/v0.1.0/Chauncy_0.1.0_x64-setup.exe';
const sha256 = 'FCA18F6E356DE7AA46CDAE650BFA80EF64D85CCB7F09FDB8A0761DD05DA6F70A';
---

<Base title="Download Chauncy for Windows" description="Download the Chauncy Windows installer and verify the release checksum.">

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container ty-container">
      <p class="eyebrow">Thanks for your purchase</p>
      <h1>Download Chauncy for Windows.</h1>
      <p class="ty-sub">
        Your receipt is handled by Stripe. Download the Windows installer below, then follow the short setup guide.
      </p>

      <a class="btn btn-primary download-btn" href={windowsDownloadUrl}>Download Chauncy for Windows</a>

      <div class="status-card">
        <h2>Release details</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Hosted on the Chauncy GitHub release</li>
          <li>Installer filename: Chauncy_0.1.0_x64-setup.exe</li>
          <li>SHA-256: {sha256}</li>
          <li>Build: Windows Launch (0.1.0)</li>
          <li>Platform: Windows 10/11, x64</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="setup-note">
        <h2>Get started in four steps</h2>
        <ol class="steps">
          <li><strong>Install.</strong> Run the installer. Requires Windows 10 or 11, 64-bit.</li>
          <li><strong>Add material.</strong> Point Chauncy at a folder of PDFs, notes, email files, or paste a few URLs you care about.</li>
          <li><strong>Ask.</strong> Search in plain English — try a question where you remember the idea, not the filename.</li>
          <li><strong>Optional AI.</strong> Core search works offline. In Settings, connect Anthropic, OpenAI, Ollama, or another endpoint only if you want synthesis.</li>
        </ol>
      </div>

      <div class="setup-note">
        <p><strong>Privacy model:</strong> Chauncy is a desktop application. Your documents and local search index stay on your machine. Optional AI features only send selected excerpts to the provider you configure.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="help-note">
        <p>Need help with installation? Email <a href="mailto:support@chauncy.dev">support@chauncy.dev</a>. 14-day money-back guarantee — see the <a href="/returns">return policy</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Base>

<style>
  .ty-container {
    max-width: 760px;
    text-align: center;
    padding-top: 3rem;
  }

  .ty-sub {
    margin: 1rem auto 2rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    max-width: 620px;
  }

  .download-btn {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .status-card,
  .setup-note,
  .help-note {
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: var(--color-surface);
    text-align: left;
  }

  .status-card ul {
    margin-top: 1rem;
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.6rem;
  }

  .steps {
    margin-top: 1rem;
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .steps strong {
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .status-card li,
  .setup-note p,
  .help-note p {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.65;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }

  .status-card li::before {
    content: '• ';
    color: var(--color-primary);
  }

  .setup-note h2 {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
  }
</style>
